t":null,"download_count":9,"created_at":"2023-08-10T08:27:20Z","updated_at":"2023-08-10T08:28:01Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/download/v2.0.1/cored-linux-amd64"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/assets/120792446","id":120792446,"node_id":"RA_kwDOHHsMMc4HMyV-","name":"cored-linux-arm64","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":60386528,"digest":null,"download_count":10,"created_at":"2023-08-09T14:14:54Z","updated_at":"2023-08-09T14:15:01Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/download/v2.0.1/cored-linux-arm64"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/tarball/v2.0.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/zipball/v2.0.1","body":"**Don't use v2.0.1 binaries. Use v2.0.2 instead**\r\n\r\n## Compatible components\r\n\r\n**Artifact**   | **Version** | **Link**\r\n--- | ---  | ---\r\nfaucet | v0.2.2 | https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/faucet/releases/tag/v0.2.2\r\nbdjuno/hasura | v0.3.0 | https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/bdjuno/releases/tag/v0.3.0\r\nbig-dipper-2 | v0.3.0 |  https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/big-dipper-2.0-cosmos/releases/tag/v0.3.0\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Spec for `delay` module by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/576\r\n* Improve integration tests timeouts to work with fast block time. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/579\r\n* Re-enabled proto check for backwards compatiblity by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/580\r\n* added init function to ibc integration tests package by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/574\r\n* Add timeout-commit for CI. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/582\r\n* Move duplicated `getIssueFee` & `getMintFee` helpers to `CoreumChain` in integr-tests by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/581\r\n* Doc on upgrading the token by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/577\r\n* first part of addressing comments by @vertex451 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/578\r\n* Integration test for upgrading from `v1` and `v2` to `v2patch1` by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/584\r\n* Don't charge burn rate and send commission on failing IBC transfers by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/583\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/compare/v2.0.0...v2.0.1","mentions_count":5},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/112769956","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/112769956/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/112769956/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/tag/v2.0.0","id":112769956,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOHHsMMc4GuLuk","tag_name":"v2.0.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"v2.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-07-18T12:03:20Z","updated_at":"2023-08-10T08:39:01Z","published_at":"2023-07-19T07:48:17Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/assets/120910399","id":120910399,"node_id":"RA_kwDOHHsMMc4HNPI_","name":"cored-linux-amd64","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"wojtek-coreum","id":103407812,"node_id":"U_kgDOBingxA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103407812?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum","html_url":"https://github.com/wojtek-coreum","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wojtek-coreum/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":64536944,"digest":null,"download_count":1870,"created_at":"2023-08-10T08:38:15Z","updated_at":"2023-08-10T08:39:01Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/download/v2.0.0/cored-linux-amd64"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/assets/120910130","id":120910130,"node_id":"RA_kwDOHHsMMc4HNPEy","name":"cored-linux-arm64","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":60378272,"digest":null,"download_count":1580,"created_at":"2023-08-10T08:35:34Z","updated_at":"2023-08-10T08:35:36Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/download/v2.0.0/cored-linux-arm64"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/tarball/v2.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/zipball/v2.0.0","body":"**Don't use v2.0.0 binaries. Use v2.0.2 instead**\r\n\r\n## Compatible components\r\n\r\n**Artifact**   | **Version** | **Link**\r\n--- | ---  | ---\r\nfaucet | v0.2.2 | https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/faucet/releases/tag/v0.2.2\r\nbdjuno/hasura | v0.3.0 | https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/bdjuno/releases/tag/v0.3.0\r\nbig-dipper-2 | v0.3.0 |  https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/big-dipper-2.0-cosmos/releases/tag/v0.3.0\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* aligned spec with docs by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/451\r\n* Add Burnt NFT invariant. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/452\r\n* Change voting period to 4h on devnet by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/453\r\n* Use simapp with option for bank benchmark integration test by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/455\r\n* Added functions to change gas adjustment on client context by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/457\r\n* Add mainnet and testnet genesis file into binary by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/456\r\n* edited freeze short description by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/458\r\n* Align spec with docs by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/459\r\n* Add nft to propo compatibility check. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/460\r\n* Use multisend and estimation in faucet by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/461\r\n* Added test to check multisig and authz work together by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/462\r\n* Automate x/deterministicgas doc generation using go:generate by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/463\r\n* Use original genesis file for EncodeGenesis for testnet and mainnet. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/468\r\n* Implemented skip unsafe flag for our integration tests by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/464\r\n* Re-enable upgrade tests by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/471\r\n* Add `go generate` command to generate deterministic gas doc by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/473\r\n* Updated readme file by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/470\r\n* changed gas-price auto in cli to initial gas price by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/474\r\n* Use `coreum-wasm-sdk` crate inside smart contracts by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/469\r\n* Increased delegation amount in TestDistributionWithdrawRewardWithDeterministicGas by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/476\r\n* Redo network config by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/472\r\n* Build smart contracts in CI by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/475\r\n* Release docker images by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/478\r\n* Fixed cored name in README docs by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/479\r\n* Asset features table by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/480\r\n* Add feature uniqueness check on the FT and NFT asset issuance. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/481\r\n* Improve the CI caching  by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/482\r\n* Adjust release workflow to the current behaviour of crust by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/477\r\n* Milad/re enable ibc by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/483\r\n* Add timeout to IBC tests and fix channel IDs by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/485\r\n* added v2 upgrade handler by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/487\r\n* Refactor integration tests to support 2 way IBC by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/486\r\n* Add query NFT classes with migration. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/484\r\n* Integrate IBC burn rate and send commission. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/489\r\n* Add NFT classes query upgrade test. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/490\r\n* Remove tmp CI refs. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/491\r\n* Add missing build tag to integration tests by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/495\r\n* removed network config for integration tests by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/496\r\n* Restore TestMain for the asset ft keeper tests. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/502\r\n* Adjust CI workflow by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/488\r\n* Add IBC CLI proposals to the app.go by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/498\r\n* Added cli to fetch ft & nft params by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/500\r\n* Get chain config for help command in the CLI root. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/501\r\n* Minor IBC integration-test improvements & fixes by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/497\r\n* Update cosmos SDK to v0.45.16. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/505\r\n* Fix the dependabot issue no 9. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/507\r\n* Smart contracts are now built automatically when linting coreum code is requested by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/509\r\n* Use @CoreumFoundation/team-blockchain in CODEOWNERS by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/512\r\n* Fix asset FT paging in the CLI. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/511\r\n* Replace zap logger to testing for the integration tests. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/508\r\n* Check run-unsafe flag for the unsafe functions instead of the unsafe tests. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/506\r\n* Handle whitelisting and freezing for IBC transfers by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/499\r\n* Refactor & simplify IBC integration-tests for asset FT by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/516\r\n* Return sdk client context from our client context by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/519\r\n* Query all types of balances for an account and denom by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/504\r\n* Bumped ibc-go version to 4.3.1 by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/522\r\n* Add raw log to the error tx response. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/523\r\n* added query to list burnt NFTs by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/521\r\n* improved TestIBCTransferFromGaiaToCoreumAndBack test by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/520\r\n* Implement FT upgrade flow by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/510\r\n* Remove tmp ref from CI by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/527\r\n* Allow IBC transfer only if it is enabled for the denom by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/526\r\n* added protodoc-markdown.tmpl by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/528\r\n* Modified all test-data wasm contracts, added new functionality, messages, queries and added integration tests by @keyleu in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/525\r\n* New authz contract example with integration tests by @keyleu in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/529\r\n* Upgrade WASM VM to v1.1.2 by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/532\r\n* Wasm IBC integration tests by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/518\r\n* Remove ref from CI by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/534\r\n* Added docs/api.md by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/535\r\n* added tag to ignore markdown-link-check by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/538\r\n* Update coreum-tools and remove  --log-format=yaml from CI. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/539\r\n* renamed protodoc-markdown.tmpl to api.tmpl.md by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/540\r\n* Validate that FT and NFT features are in the defined set by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/530\r\n* Add comment for the github.com/btcsuite/btcd replacement. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/541\r\n* Base64 encoding/decoding of datastring by @keyleu in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/537\r\n* new coreum_wasm_sdk features (version upgrade) and integration tests by @keyleu in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/536\r\n* Add more tests for FT global freeze + IBC by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/549\r\n* Remove restore key for the docker cache to reset it on reinit. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/548\r\n* Add binaries cache for the CI. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/552\r\n* Test timing out IBC core transfer by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/547\r\n* Migrate contract test by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/550\r\n* Remove temp CI ref. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/554\r\n* Move address prefix from network config to provider by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/544\r\n* Document IBC feature by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/551\r\n* Test IBC transfer rejection by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/555\r\n* Fix bug in the fuzzy test of the fee model by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/556\r\n* Test that FT params for token upgrade are correctly set after chain upgrade by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/563\r\n* CLI command for upgrading FTs by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/557\r\n* Set FT upgrade decision period to 3 weeks by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/562\r\n* Update wasm_test names (IBC tests post review). by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/559\r\n* Wrapper for extracting error from tx result in CLI tests by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/565\r\n* added RecommendedGasPrice endpoint by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/543\r\n* added migrations for NFT data created by smart contracts by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/553\r\n* Use SDK error wrappers by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/567\r\n* Remove `funlen` from tests by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/568\r\n* Implement amino txs encode/decode for coreum modules. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/566\r\n* Removed leftover TODOs by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/564\r\n* IBC rejection and timeout tests for FTs by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/561\r\n* Support multisig accounts in gas simulation by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/573\r\n* Added CLI command to QueryRecommendedGasPrice by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/571\r\n* Add TokenUpgradeStatuses query. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/570\r\n* Use SDK error wrappers, part 2 by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/572\r\n* Add deterministic_gas_factor_exceed_expected_max metric. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/575\r\n* Bumped Coreum go module version to v2 by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/569\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @keyleu made their first contribution in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/525\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/compare/v1.0.0...v2.0.0","mentions_count":5},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/112661074","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/112661074/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/112661074/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFou