ek-coreum/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":60378272,"digest":null,"download_count":7,"created_at":"2023-08-10T09:02:01Z","updated_at":"2023-08-10T09:02:31Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/download/v2.0.0-rc1/cored-linux-arm64"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/tarball/v2.0.0-rc1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/zipball/v2.0.0-rc1","body":"## Compatible components\r\n\r\n**Artifact**   | **Version** | **Link**\r\n--- | ---  | ---\r\nfaucet | v0.2.2 | https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/faucet/releases/tag/v0.2.2\r\nbdjuno/hasura | v0.3.0 | https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/bdjuno/releases/tag/v0.3.0\r\nbig-dipper-2 | v0.3.0 |  https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/big-dipper-2.0-cosmos/releases/tag/v0.3.0\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* aligned spec with docs by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/451\r\n* Add Burnt NFT invariant. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/452\r\n* Change voting period to 4h on devnet by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/453\r\n* Use simapp with option for bank benchmark integration test by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/455\r\n* Added functions to change gas adjustment on client context by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/457\r\n* Add mainnet and testnet genesis file into binary by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/456\r\n* edited freeze short description by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/458\r\n* Align spec with docs by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/459\r\n* Add nft to propo compatibility check. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/460\r\n* Use multisend and estimation in faucet by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/461\r\n* Added test to check multisig and authz work together by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/462\r\n* Automate x/deterministicgas doc generation using go:generate by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/463\r\n* Use original genesis file for EncodeGenesis for testnet and mainnet. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/468\r\n* Implemented skip unsafe flag for our integration tests by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/464\r\n* Re-enable upgrade tests by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/471\r\n* Add `go generate` command to generate deterministic gas doc by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/473\r\n* Updated readme file by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/470\r\n* changed gas-price auto in cli to initial gas price by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/474\r\n* Use `coreum-wasm-sdk` crate inside smart contracts by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/469\r\n* Increased delegation amount in TestDistributionWithdrawRewardWithDeterministicGas by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/476\r\n* Redo network config by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/472\r\n* Build smart contracts in CI by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/475\r\n* Release docker images by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/478\r\n* Fixed cored name in README docs by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/479\r\n* Asset features table by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/480\r\n* Add feature uniqueness check on the FT and NFT asset issuance. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/481\r\n* Improve the CI caching  by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/482\r\n* Adjust release workflow to the current behaviour of crust by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/477\r\n* Milad/re enable ibc by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/483\r\n* Add timeout to IBC tests and fix channel IDs by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/485\r\n* added v2 upgrade handler by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/487\r\n* Refactor integration tests to support 2 way IBC by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/486\r\n* Add query NFT classes with migration. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/484\r\n* Integrate IBC burn rate and send commission. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/489\r\n* Add NFT classes query upgrade test. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/490\r\n* Remove tmp CI refs. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/491\r\n* Add missing build tag to integration tests by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/495\r\n* removed network config for integration tests by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/496\r\n* Restore TestMain for the asset ft keeper tests. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/502\r\n* Adjust CI workflow by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/488\r\n* Add IBC CLI proposals to the app.go by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/498\r\n* Added cli to fetch ft & nft params by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/500\r\n* Get chain config for help command in the CLI root. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/501\r\n* Minor IBC integration-test improvements & fixes by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/497\r\n* Update cosmos SDK to v0.45.16. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/505\r\n* Fix the dependabot issue no 9. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/507\r\n* Smart contracts are now built automatically when linting coreum code is requested by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/509\r\n* Use @CoreumFoundation/team-blockchain in CODEOWNERS by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/512\r\n* Fix asset FT paging in the CLI. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/511\r\n* Replace zap logger to testing for the integration tests. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/508\r\n* Check run-unsafe flag for the unsafe functions instead of the unsafe tests. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/506\r\n* Handle whitelisting and freezing for IBC transfers by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/499\r\n* Refactor & simplify IBC integration-tests for asset FT by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/516\r\n* Return sdk client context from our client context by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/519\r\n* Query all types of balances for an account and denom by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/504\r\n* Bumped ibc-go version to 4.3.1 by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/522\r\n* Add raw log to the error tx response. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/523\r\n* added query to list burnt NFTs by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/521\r\n* improved TestIBCTransferFromGaiaToCoreumAndBack test by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/520\r\n* Implement FT upgrade flow by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/510\r\n* Remove tmp ref from CI by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/527\r\n* Allow IBC transfer only if it is enabled for the denom by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/526\r\n* added protodoc-markdown.tmpl by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/528\r\n* Modified all test-data wasm contracts, added new functionality, messages, queries and added integration tests by @keyleu in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/525\r\n* New authz contract example with integration tests by @keyleu in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/529\r\n* Upgrade WASM VM to v1.1.2 by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/532\r\n* Wasm IBC integration tests by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/518\r\n* Remove ref from CI by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/534\r\n* Added docs/api.md by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/535\r\n* added tag to ignore markdown-link-check by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/538\r\n* Update coreum-tools and remove  --log-format=yaml from CI. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/539\r\n* renamed protodoc-markdown.tmpl to api.tmpl.md by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/540\r\n* Validate that FT and NFT features are in the defined set by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/530\r\n* Add comment for the github.com/btcsuite/btcd replacement. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/541\r\n* Base64 encoding/decoding of datastring by @keyleu in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/537\r\n* new coreum_wasm_sdk features (version upgrade) and integration tests by @keyleu in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/536\r\n* Add more tests for FT global freeze + IBC by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/549\r\n* Remove restore key for the docker cache to reset it on reinit. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/548\r\n* Add binaries cache for the CI. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/552\r\n* Test timing out IBC core transfer by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/547\r\n* Migrate contract test by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/550\r\n* Remove temp CI ref. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/554\r\n* Move address prefix from network config to provider by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/544\r\n* Document IBC feature by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/551\r\n* Test IBC transfer rejection by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/555\r\n* Fix bug in the fuzzy test of the fee model by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/556\r\n* Test that FT params for token upgrade are correctly set after chain upgrade by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/563\r\n* CLI command for upgrading FTs by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/557\r\n* Set FT upgrade decision period to 3 weeks by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/562\r\n* Update wasm_test names (IBC tests post review). by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/559\r\n* Wrapper for extracting error from tx result in CLI tests by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/565\r\n* added RecommendedGasPrice endpoint by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/543\r\n* added migrations for NFT data created by smart contracts by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/553\r\n* Use SDK error wrappers by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/567\r\n* Remove `funlen` from tests by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/568\r\n* Implement amino txs encode/decode for coreum modules. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/566\r\n* Removed leftover TODOs by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/564\r\n* IBC rejection and timeout tests for FTs by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/561\r\n* Support multisig accounts in gas simulation by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/573\r\n* Added CLI command to QueryRecommendedGasPrice by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/571\r\n* Add TokenUpgradeStatuses query. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/570\r\n* Use SDK error wrappers, part 2 by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/572\r\n* Add deterministic_gas_factor_exceed_expected_max metric. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/575\r\n* Bumped Coreum go module version to v2 by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/569\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @keyleu made their first contribution in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/525\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/compare/v1.0.0...v2.0.0-rc1","mentions_count":5},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/95882509","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/95882509/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/95882509/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/tag/v1.0.0","id":95882509,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOHHsMMc4Ftw0N","tag_name":"v1.0.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"v1.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-03-16T17:23:14Z","updated_at":"2023-03-17T12:47:51Z","published_at":"2023-03-16T17:35:14Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/assets/99680108","id":99680108,"node_id":"RA_kwDOHHsMMc4F8P9s","name":"cored-linux-amd64","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":64076720,"digest":null,"download_count":12651,"created_at":"2023-03-16T17:35:15Z","updated_at":"2023-03-16T17:35:18Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/download/v1.0.0/cored-linux-amd64"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/assets/99680107","id":99680107,"node_id":"RA_kwDOHHsMMc4F8P9r","name":"cored-linux-arm64","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":60077760,"digest":null,"download_count":2695,"created_at":"2023-03-16T17:35:15Z","updated_at":"2023-03-16T17:35:17Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/download/v1.0.0/cored-linux-arm64"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/tarball/v1.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/zipball/v1.0.0","body":"## Compatible components\r\n\r\n**Artifact**   | **Version** | **Link**\r\n--- | ---  | ---\r\nfaucet | v0.2.0 | https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/faucet/releases/tag/v0.2.0\r\nbdjuno/hasura | v0.2.1 | https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/bdjuno/releases/tag/v0.2.1\r\nbig-dipper-2 | v0.2.0 |  https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/big-dipper-2.0-cosmos/releases/tag/v0.2.0\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Revert NFT cleanup. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/357\r\n* Prohibit to freeze and whitelist of the FT on the issuer account. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/353\r\n* Add an invariant to test the frozen and whitelisted balances with the corresponding disabled feature. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/356\r\n* implemented nft freezing by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/347\r\n* Add test to verify testnet genesis hash. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/359\r\n* Apply linter config changes by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/365\r\n* added docs to describe asset ft behavior by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/351\r\n* Move deterministic gas config to `x/deterministicgas` by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/361\r\n* Add protobuf breaking change check. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/366\r\n* Finalized `pkg/client`, extracted config by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/369\r\n* Integrate WASM handlers for the asset ft module. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/349\r\n* Integrate vesting module. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/360\r\n* Update CI repos flat to test-groups. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/371\r\n* Add unknown message metric. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/368\r\n* Update deterministic gas table doc by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/375\r\n* implemented NFT whitelisting by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/364\r\n* added disable sending and royalty rate by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/367\r\n* GRPC client for the client package. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/378\r\n* Update devnet config to be deployd by new flow. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/384\r\n* Test if there are any new, unknown proposals used by `cored` by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/376\r\n* Remove deprecated REST proposal handlers by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/374\r\n* Make `MsgSubmitProposal` a nondeterministic message by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/377\r\n* Wait for one block in gas_price_test by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/382\r\n* Update devnet seeds. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/385\r\n* Use testnet prefixes in the CLI examples. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/383\r\n* Added more test cases for fungible token by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/381\r\n* validate token metadata before registering on the bank module by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/379\r\n* Added validate precision and subunit by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/380\r\n* added chain-id flag to integration tests by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/391\r\n* fix readme by @pgoos in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/386\r\n* Integrate IBC modules by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/387\r\n* Set default min gas price to 0.00000000000000001chain-denom. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/388\r\n* Remove not needed TODOs and FIXMEs by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/392\r\n* Use grpc only for the integration tests. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/390\r\n* added validation for max block gas by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/397\r\n* Fixed validator key extraction in app export by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/395\r\n* register asset ft and nft message types in RegisterImplementations by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/396\r\n* Run CI workflow using self-hosted runner & minor CI hotfixes by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/402\r\n* Remove responses from ignored message types in test by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/394\r\n* added overhead in gasprice query in cli by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/401\r\n* Don't require fee for simulation by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/403\r\n* Undeterministic -> nondeterministic by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/400\r\n* extend nft whitelist integration test by @pgoos in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/398\r\n* Create ante decorator blocking defined messages by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/399\r\n* Run CI using self-hosted runners by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/404\r\n* Disable faucet & coreum-upgrade integration-tests in CI by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/410\r\n* Fixes required by simulator by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/408\r\n* Upgrade cosmos sdk to v0.45.14 by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/407\r\n* fix validation for min_self_deletation by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/406\r\n* added nft invariants by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/405\r\n* Enable & partially configure coreum-mainnet-1 network by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/409\r\n* Give priority to GRPC client inside `Invoke` by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/422\r\n* Make the query path for whitelisted account more RESTful by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/415\r\n* Fix randomly failing test by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/421\r\n* Adjust sequence of methods in keepers of FT and NFT by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/417\r\n* Add params queries to NFT and FT by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/413\r\n* Remove IBC integration by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/420\r\n* changed prompt printed as description of cored CLI by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/424\r\n* Replace `cnft` with `nft` in CLI by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/427\r\n* Return error if fee contains more than one denom by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/419\r\n* Added ibc to preserved words in subunit validation by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/423\r\n* Restore CI to its original form by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/426\r\n* Complex ft integration tests (phase 2) by @pgoos in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/418\r\n* Wait for one more block in upgrade test by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/431\r\n* removed todos for feemodel params by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/432\r\n* NFT issuer does not need whitelisting by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/414\r\n* Wasm asset NFT / native NFT integration by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/428\r\n* added complex integration tests for NFTs by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/425\r\n* Implemented complex integration tests phase 4 by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/416\r\n* fixed some typos in the comments by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/430\r\n* fixed typos in wstaking error messages by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/433\r\n* Added docs to the NFT module by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/412\r\n* Burnt NFT IDs cannot be reused by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/429\r\n* added more validation to asset ft genesis by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/434\r\n* fixed asset ft keeper test to use correct address prefix by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/435\r\n* check there are no duplicate accounts in funded accounts list by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/436\r\n* Update chains config by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/437\r\n* Finalize mainnet network integration by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/438\r\n* Register asset NFT rest route. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/439\r\n* Update mainnet genesis with new accounts & decrease create validator stake by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/441\r\n* added more validation to asset nft genesis by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/443\r\n* fixed some comments and typos in nft module by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/444\r\n* added extra check to nft symbol in Deconstruct function by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/446\r\n* validate nft genesis by @miladz68 in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/447\r\n* edited seeds ports by @silverspase in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/448\r\n* Registering proposal handlers is required despite the fact that rest is deprecated, because the same function registers CLI commands in gov/submit-proposal by @wojtek-coreum in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/445\r\n* Replace tmp addresses in mainnet genesis with real ones by @ysv in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/449\r\n* Use binary data for wasm nft data attributes. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/450\r\n* Add genesis sources and include them to the tests. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/442\r\n* Add the v1 migration. by @dzmitryhil in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/440\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @pgoos made their first contribution in https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/pull/386\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/compare/v0.1.1...v1.0.0","mentions_count":6},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/95719460","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/95719460/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/95719460/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CoreumFoundation/coreum/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc2",